notes               = "Untitled in source. The dedication برای دخترم سارا ('for my daughter Sara') is printed in the outer margin. Rhymed on -ابی‌ست (مهتابی‌ست / آبی‌ست / بی‌تابی‌ست / بی‌آبی‌ست) and it closes by repeating its first line, like free-song (188). Companion to empty-house (176), which does the same thing for the other daughter: a house lit by an absent child. 7 Farvardin = 27 March 2005. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

خانه با یادِ تو مهتابی‌ست...
تشنه‌ام... اما...
مهرِ رویت در دلم آبی‌ست...
تشنگی... انگورِ سرخِ تاکِ بی‌تابی‌ست...
دستِ پُر مهر تو جامم باد...
جامِ بی‌عشقت حرامم باد...
فصلِ باران...
فصلِ بی‌آبی‌ست...
ماهِ پشت ابر پنهان است...
خانه با یاد تو... مهتابی‌ست...
۱۳۸۴/۱/۷

===machine===

The house, remembering you, is full of moonlight...
I am thirsty... and yet...
the love of your face is blue water in my heart...
Thirst... is the red grape of the restless vine...
Let your kind hand be my cup...
Let any cup without your love be forbidden me...
The season of rain...
is the season of no water...
The moon is hidden behind the cloud...
The house, remembering you... is full of moonlight...
1384/1/7

===lantern===

The house, remembering you, is full of moonlight.
I am thirsty — and even so
the love of your face is blue water in my heart.
Thirst is the red grape of the restless vine.
Let your kind hand be my cup;
let any cup without your love be forbidden me.
The season of rain
is the season of no water.
The moon is hidden behind the cloud.
The house, remembering you, is full of moonlight...

1384/1/7

